OL,5,G2100 The Big Interview: Louis Walsh
OL,6,     FColette Fitzpatrick sits down with
OL,7,     FLouis Walsh to reflect on his
OL,8,     Fcareer managing pop superstars,
OL,9,     Fjudging talent shows and life in
OL,10,     Fthe spotlight.
OL,11,G2205 The Tonight Show
OL,12,     FComment and analysis on the big
OL,13,     Fstories of the day in Ireland and
OL,14,     Fabroad with a panel of guests
OL,15,     Fcovering the key issues.
OL,16,G2305 The 1% Club
OL,17,     FForget what you know, it's all
OL,18,     Fabout how you think! With Lee Mack
OL,19,     Fat the helm, The 1% Club serves up
OL,20,     Fbrain-teasing questions that
OL,21,     Fanyone can answer, but only a few
OL,22,     Fcan solve.
