OL,5,G0005 Living with Lucy
OL,6,     FWe kick off the brand new series
OL,7,     Fof 'Living with Lucy' with GAA
OL,8,     Flegend Davy Fitz. Lucy heads to
OL,9,     FSixmilebridge Co. Clare, where
OL,10,     FDavy is living with his partner
OL,11,     Fand his son.
OL,12,G0100 The Bay
OL,13,     FAs the team press on with the
OL,14,     Finvestigation, Lisa and Med dig
OL,15,     Fdeeper into the family and
OL,16,     Fdiscover not all relationships
OL,17,     Fwith the victim were amicable.
